query TT
EXPLAIN
SELECT "Title", COUNT(*) AS PageViews FROM hits WHERE "CounterID" = 62 AND "EventDate" >= '2013-07-01' AND "EventDate" <= '2013-07-31' AND "DontCountHits" = 0 AND "IsRefresh" = 0 AND "Title" <> '' GROUP BY "Title" ORDER BY PageViews DESC LIMIT 10;
----
logical_plan
01)Sort: pageviews DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10
02)--Projection: hits.Title, count(Int64(1)) AS count(*) AS pageviews
03)----Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.Title]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]
04)------Projection: hits.Title
05)--------Filter: hits.CounterID = Int32(62) AND hits.EventDate >= TimestampMicrosecond(1372636800000000, None) AND hits.EventDate <= TimestampMicrosecond(1375228800000000, None) AND hits.DontCountHits = Int16(0) AND hits.IsRefresh = Int16(0) AND hits.Title != Utf8View("")
06)----------TableScan: hits projection=[Title, EventDate, CounterID, IsRefresh, DontCountHits], partial_filters=[hits.CounterID = Int32(62), hits.EventDate >= TimestampMicrosecond(1372636800000000, None), hits.EventDate <= TimestampMicrosecond(1375228800000000, None), hits.DontCountHits = Int16(0), hits.IsRefresh = Int16(0), hits.Title != Utf8View("")]
physical_plan
01)SortPreservingMergeExec: [pageviews@1 DESC], fetch=10
02)--ProjectionExec: expr=[Title@0 as Title, count(Int64(1))@1 as pageviews]
03)----SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[count(Int64(1))@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]
04)------AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[Title@0 as Title], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]
05)--------RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([Title@0], 4), input_partitions=4
06)----------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[Title@0 as Title], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]
07)------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={4 groups: [[${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>]]}, projection=[Title], file_type=vortex, predicate: CounterID@6 = 62 AND EventDate@5 >= 1372636800000000 AND EventDate@5 <= 1375228800000000 AND DontCountHits@61 = 0 AND IsRefresh@15 = 0 AND Title@2 != 
